ng played"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"kāṉal","gloss":"seaside grove"}],"gloss":"seaside grove"},{"surface":"அல்கியும்","parts":[{"text":"அல்கி","lemma":"alku","gloss":"having stayed"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and having stayed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தொடலை","parts":[{"text":"தொடலை","lemma":"toṭalai","gloss":"garland/linked"}],"gloss":"garlanded"},{"surface":"ஆயமொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஆயம்","lemma":"āyam","gloss":"group of playmates"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"oṭu","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the playmates"},{"surface":"தழுவணி","parts":[{"text":"தழுவு","lemma":"taḻuvu","gloss":"embracing"},{"text":"அணி","lemma":"aṇi","gloss":"beauty/adornment"}],"gloss":"the beautiful embrace"},{"surface":"அயர்ந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"அயர்ந்து","lemma":"ayaru","gloss":"having performed/celebrated"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and having celebrated"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நொதுமலர்","parts":[{"text":"நொதுமலர்","lemma":"notumalar","gloss":"strangers"}],"gloss":"strangers"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"கதுமென","parts":[{"text":"கதுமென","lemma":"katumeṉa","gloss":"suddenly"}],"gloss":"suddenly"},{"surface":"வந்து","parts":[{"text":"வந்து","lemma":"varu","gloss":"having come"}],"gloss":"having come"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முயங்கினன்","parts":[{"text":"முயங்கினன்","lemma":"muyaṅku","gloss":"he embraced"}],"gloss":"he embraced"},{"surface":"செலினே","parts":[{"text":"செலின்","lemma":"cel","gloss":"if he goes"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"if he goes indeed"},{"surface":"அலர்ந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"அலர்ந்தன்று","lemma":"அலர்ந்தன்று","gloss":"it would have become public gossip indeed"}],"gloss":"it would have become public gossip indeed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"maṉ","gloss":"particle of regret"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"alas"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தித்தி","parts":[{"text":"தித்தி","lemma":"titti","gloss":"beauty spots"}],"gloss":"beauty spots"},{"surface":"பரந்த","parts":[{"text":"பரந்த","lemma":"para","gloss":"spread"}],"gloss":"spread"},{"surface":"பைத்து","parts":[{"text":"பைத்து","lemma":"pai","gloss":"freshness/greenness"}],"gloss":"fresh"},{"surface":"அகல்","parts":[{"text":"அகல்","lemma":"akal","gloss":"wide"}],"gloss":"wide"},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"alkul","gloss":"loins/hips"}],"gloss":"hips"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திருந்திழை","parts":[{"text":"திருந்து","lemma":"tiruntu","gloss":"perfected"},{"text":"இழை","lemma":"iḻai","gloss":"jewel"}],"gloss":"perfected jewels"},{"surface":"துயல்வுக்கோட்டு","parts":[{"text":"துயல்வுக்கோட்டு","lemma":"துயல்வுக்கோட்டு","gloss":"swaying branch"}],"gloss":"swaying branch","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அசைத்த","parts":[{"text":"அசைத்த","lemma":"acaittāl","gloss":"fastened"}],"gloss":"fastened"},{"surface":"பசுங்குழை","parts":[{"text":"பசுமை","lemma":"pacu","gloss":"green"},{"text":"குழை","lemma":"kuḻai","gloss":"sprout/leaf"}],"gloss":"green sprouts"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தழையினும்","parts":[{"text":"தழை","lemma":"taḻai","gloss":"leaf garment"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"than"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even more than the leaf garment"},{"surface":"உழையின்","parts":[{"text":"உழை","lemma":"uḻai","gloss":"nearness/vicinity"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"from her side"},{"surface":"போகான்","parts":[{"text":"போகான்","lemma":"pō","gloss":"he will not go"}],"gloss":"he does not go away"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தான்","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"tāṉ","gloss":"he himself"}],"gloss":"he himself"},{"surface":"தந்தனன்","parts":[{"text":"தந்தனன்","lemma":"tā","gloss":"he gave"}],"gloss":"gave it"},{"surface":"யாய்","parts":[{"text":"யாய்","lemma":"yāy","gloss":"my mother"}],"gloss":"O mother"},{"surface":"காத்து","parts":[{"text":"காத்து","lemma":"kā","gloss":"protecting"}],"gloss":"protecting"},{"surface":"ஓம்பல்லே","parts":[{"text":"ஓம்பல்","lemma":"ōmpu","gloss":"guarding/cherishing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"do guard her indeed"}]}],"literal":"Playing with the sea and staying in the seaside grove / and celebrating the beautiful embrace with the garlanded playmates, / if he, coming suddenly like a stranger, / embraced her and left, indeed gossip would have arisen. / But, closer than the leaf garment of green sprouts / fastened from swaying branches, worn on her wide hips spread with beauty spots and adorned with perfect jewels, / he does not go away from her side. / He himself gave it; O mother, protect her carefully!","translation":"If he had come suddenly like a stranger, embraced her, and gone away after we played in the sea, stayed in the seaside grove, and celebrated the festival of embraces with our garlanded playmates, gossip would have surely arisen. But he does not leave her side, staying even closer than the garment of fresh green leaves plucked from swaying branches that she wears on her wide hips adorned with beauty spots and perfect jewels. He himself gave this leaf garment to her. O mother, guard her well!","modern":"கடலில் விளையாடியும், கடற்கரைச் சோலையில் தங்கியும், மாலை அணிந்த தோழியர் கூட்டத்துடன் தழுவி விளையாடியும் மகிழ்ந்தோம். அப்போது அவன் ஒரு புதியவனைப் போலத் திடீரென்று வந்து, அவளைத் தழுவிவிட்டுச் சென்றிருந்தால் ஊரார் அலர் தூற்றியிருப்பார்கள். ஆனால், அழகிய புள்ளிகள் படர்ந்த அவளது அகன்ற அல்குலில், அசையும் கிளைகளிலிருந்து பறித்துக் கட்டிய பசுமையான தழையாடையை விடவும் நெருக்கமாக அவன் எப்போதும் அவளது பக்கத்திலேயே இருக்கிறான். அந்தத் தழையாடையையும் அவனே அவளுக்குத் தந்தான். தாயே! நீ அவளைப் பாதுகாப்பாயாக!","explanation":"In this poem of the Neytal (coastal) landscape, the friend (tōḻi) is revealing the heroine's secret love affair to the foster-mother (aṟattoṭu niṟṟal). She explains that the hero is not a passing stranger who would embrace the heroine and leave, causing scandalous gossip. Instead, he is deeply committed and stays closer to her than the very leaf garment she wears. This leaf garment, made of fresh green sprouts from swaying branches, was gifted by the hero himself as a token of courtship. By sharing this, the friend gently urges the mother to accept their love and protect the heroine by preparing for their marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.55],[0.55,0.8],[0.8,1.04],[1.16,1.8],[1.8,2.6],[2.65,2.9],[2.9,3.73],[3.73,4.3],[4.3,4.99],[4.99,5.4],[5.4,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.3],[7.3,7.5],[7.6,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,8.86],[8.86,9.33],[9.33,9.81],[9.93,10.5],[10.5,10.9],[11.13,12.54],[12.54,12.9],[12.9,13.5],[14.26,14.58],[14.69,15.1],[15.1,15.4],[15.4,15.95],[15.95,16.65],[16.65,17.2],[17.2,17.38]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.16],[1.34,2.2],[2.2,2.9],[2.95,3.2],[3.36,4.0],[4.17,4.7],[4.7,5.45],[5.45,5.9],[5.9,6.6],[6.6,6.9],[6.9,7.9],[8.13,8.37],[8.37,9.3],[9.3,9.6],[9.8,10.31],[10.31,11.0],[11.0,11.2],[11.2,12.4],[12.4,13.83],[13.83,14.57],[14.57,15.2],[15.2,15.96],[16.13,16.62],[16.78,16.95],[16.95,17.4],[17.4,18.0],[18.0,18.75],[18.75,19.35],[19.35,20.0]]},"sync":[[["கடலுடன்","with the sea"]],[["கடலுடன்","with the sea"],["ஆடியும்","and having played"]],[["கானல்","seaside grove"]],[["கானல்","seaside grove"],["அல்கியும்","and having stayed"]],[["தொடலை","garlanded"]],[["ஆயமொடு","with the playmates"]],[["தழுவணி","the beautiful embrace"]],[["அயர்ந்தும்","and having celebrated"]],[["நொதுமலர்","strangers"]],[["போல","like"],["கதுமென","suddenly"]],[["கதுமென","suddenly"]],[["வந்து","having come"]],[["முயங்கினன்","he embraced"]],[["செலினே","if he goes indeed"]],[["அலர்ந்தன்று","it would have become public gossip indeed"]],[["மன்னே","alas"]],[["தித்தி","beauty spots"]],[["பரந்த","spread"]],[["பைத்து","fresh"],["அகல்","wide"]],[["அகல்","wide"],["அல்குல்","hips"]],[["திருந்திழை","perfected jewels"]],[["துயல்வுக்கோட்டு","swaying branch"]],[["துயல்வுக்கோட்டு","swaying branch"],["அசைத்த","fastened"]],[["பசுங்குழை","green sprouts"]],[["தழையினும்","even more than the leaf garment"]],[["உழையின்","from her side"]],[["போகான்","he does not go away"]],[["தான்","he himself"],["தந்தனன்","gave it"]],[["தந்தனன்","gave it"],["யாய்","O mother"]],[["காத்து","protecting"],["ஓம்பல்லே","do guard her indeed"]],[["ஓம்பல்லே","do guard her indeed"]]]}